{"id":"02e8de7bfb004da1","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-abstract-enumeration-map.md","title":"Adequate Enumeration Maps and Relative Omega Consistency","display":"df-abstract-enumeration-map — Adequate Enumeration Maps and Relative Omega Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-abstract-enumeration-map","aliases":["92-df-abstract-enumeration-map"],"display":"df-abstract-enumeration-map — Adequate Enumeration Maps and Relative Omega Consistency","source":"第 XI 章 pp. 127–128（PDF 144–145）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-abstract-enumeration-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-abstract-enumeration-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-enumeration-map — Adequate Enumeration Maps and Relative Omega Consistency"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 pp. 127–128（PDF 144–145）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c85c79ae7f29681\" href=\"?note=7c85c79ae7f29681\" title=\"92-df-abstract-provability-system\">92-df-abstract-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:S\\times\\mathbb N\\to S\">\\(\\Phi:S\\times\\mathbb N\\to S\\)</span> 为候选映射。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M,\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M,\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\">\\(\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M,\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M,\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}\\)</span> 为以下定义的元语言谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_M\">\\(\\neg_M\\)</span> 使用抽象系统的派生否定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in S\\;[(X\\in P\\Longrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Phi(X,n)\\in P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land(X\\notin P\\Longrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg_M\\Phi(X,n)\\in P)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M(\\Phi)\\land\n\\forall X\\in S\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\Phi(X,n)\\in P\\Longrightarrow BX\\in P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in S\\;(BX\\in P\\Longrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg_M\\Phi(X,n)\\notin P).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in S\\;[(X\\in P\\Longrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Phi(X,n)\\in P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land(X\\notin P\\Longrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg_M\\Phi(X,n)\\in P)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M(\\Phi)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M(\\Phi)\\land\n\\forall X\\in S\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\Phi(X,n)\\in P\\Longrightarrow BX\\in P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in S\\;(BX\\in P\\Longrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg_M\\Phi(X,n)\\notin P).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书枚举映射的两个方向不对称：X 可证时须有一个正的阶段实例可证；X 不可证时须每个阶段的否定都可证。这不是仅在外部计算机上输出 P 的一般 c.e. 枚举，也没有预设数码、编码或一阶量词。</p>\n<p>Adeq 进一步把一个正阶段实例内化为 BX。相对 ω 相容只针对给定 Φ，并且要求至少一个阶段的否定不可证；它不是普通相容的别名，也不是“所有阶段都否定不可证”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:S\\times\\mathbb N\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M,\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M,\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}map}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M(\\Phi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in S\\;[(X\\in P\\Longrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Phi(X,n)\\in P)\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\land(X\\notin P\\Longrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg_M\\Phi(X,n)\\in P)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M(\\Phi)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M(\\Phi)\\land\n\\forall X\\in S\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\Phi(X,n)\\in P\\Longrightarrow BX\\in P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in S\\;(BX\\in P\\Longrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg_M\\Phi(X,n)\\notin P).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1903,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-truth-set]] → [[92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness]]；[[92-df-abstract-enumeration-map]] → [[92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable]] → [[92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness]]。这里的真固定点与可证固定点、Φ 枚举与外部 c.e. 枚举分别保留。"},{"id":"c5f2d99ce132fb68","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-enumeration-map]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-enumeration-map]]"}],"outgoing":["7c85c79ae7f29681"]}